{"id":"ko-a1-l007","level":7,"title":"A1 第 7 課 · 草稿候選","status":"draft","head":"7921eeba48ab0de39ec6d4b0797d7ea824e1070b","branch":"luna/ko-a1-l007-data-20261028","sourceRepo":"stasischen/content-ko","sourceFiles":[{"path":"content_v2/review/lessons/ko-a1-l007/core/lesson.json","sha256":"d6339eb72a391be67b53e9758735965cc048233cabb53017e7fee9d741838f91"},{"path":"content_v2/review/lessons/ko-a1-l007/core/sentences.json","sha256":"57ea0ea856ae71fcec71a80e5d53060fb4dbacd9386f7d8ca853652907b19507"},{"path":"content_v2/review/lessons/ko-a1-l007/draft/i18n/zh_tw/lesson.json","sha256":"8e42397074392ac603b78f6ae8414cb63b3e7f20ea928b0b7eb539d2529678fa"},{"path":"content_v2/review/lessons/ko-a1-l007/draft/i18n/zh_tw/sentences.json","sha256":"6e03ed2673d33bb86b28597fa404b28dffcb11f474623abb11b09e078ee07657"}],"dialogue":[{"id":"scene.d1","title":"情境 1","location":"","context":"週六在中心的語言交換活動中，安妮向麥可借原子筆，獲得同意並接過筆。","purpose":"","turns":[{"speaker":"安妮","korean":"마이클 씨, 볼펜 좀 빌려 주세요.","translation":"麥可，借我一下原子筆。"},{"speaker":"麥可","korean":"네, 여기요. 이거 쓰세요.","translation":"好，給你。用這支吧。"},{"speaker":"安妮","korean":"고마워요. 잠깐만 쓸게요.","translation":"謝謝，我用一下就好。"},{"speaker":"麥可","korean":"네, 괜찮아요.","translation":"好，沒關係。"},{"speaker":"安妮","korean":"다 썼어요. 여기요. 고마워요.","translation":"我用好了。還你。謝謝。"},{"speaker":"麥可","korean":"네.","translation":"好。"}]},{"id":"scene.d2","title":"情境 2","location":"","context":"咖啡館裡三人正在參加讀書會，安妮向由紀借橡皮擦，等由紀用完後接過橡皮擦並致謝。","purpose":"","turns":[{"speaker":"安妮","korean":"유키 씨, 지우개 좀 빌려 주세요.","translation":"由紀，借我一下橡皮擦。"},{"speaker":"由紀","korean":"미안해요. 지금 쓰고 있어요.","translation":"抱歉，我現在在用。"},{"speaker":"安妮","korean":"네, 기다릴게요.","translation":"好，我等你。"},{"speaker":"由紀","korean":"다 썼어요. 여기요.","translation":"我用好了，給你。"},{"speaker":"安妮","korean":"고마워요.","translation":"謝謝。"}]},{"id":"scene.d3","title":"情境 3","location":"","context":"白天安妮在文具店想看高處架上的筆記本，請店員幫忙拿筆記本，店員拿給了她。","purpose":"","turns":[{"speaker":"安妮","korean":"저기요. 저 위에 있는 공책 좀 꺼내 주세요.","translation":"不好意思，請幫我拿一下上面那本筆記本。"},{"speaker":"店員","korean":"이 파란 공책이요?","translation":"這本藍色的嗎？"},{"speaker":"安妮","korean":"네. 너무 높아요.","translation":"對，太高了。"},{"speaker":"店員","korean":"여기 있어요. 한번 보세요.","translation":"在這裡，你看一下。"},{"speaker":"安妮","korean":"네, 고맙습니다.","translation":"好，謝謝。"}]}],"article":{"title":"","rows":[]},"notes":[{"section":"候選狀態","line":1,"text":"Data card state: done; candidate preview only, not user-accepted, merged, or published."}]}
